                    "line": 1864,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "Why do we need the subtraction? Is `sizeof(pldm_entity)` not accounted for in `new_record->size`?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/dsp/pdr.c",
                    "line": 1864,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Archana Kakani",
                        "email": "archana.kakani@ibm.com",
                        "username": "ArchanaKakani"
                    },
                    "message": "The Entity Association PDR structure includes pldm_entity for the one child. However when removing the last contained entity from the Entity PDR, there willnot be any child in the EA PDR. Therefore the minimum required size is:\npldm_pdr_hdr + pldm_pdr_entity_association - pldm_entity, which represents an Entity Association PDR without any contained entities."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/dsp/pdr.c",
                    "line": 1864,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "Acknowledged"
                }
            ],
